OL,4,G0600FAfrodeutsche
OL,5,     GNeed to slow things down?
OL,6,     GAfrodeutsche brings the mellow
OL,7,     GSaturday flow you need to really
OL,8,     Ghit that deeply relaxing vibe.
OL,9,G0800FRadcliffe and Maconie
OL,10,     GMark and Stuart present a feast
OL,11,     Gof great music and chat for
OL,12,     Gweekend breakfast. With tracks
OL,13,     Gfrom Talking Heads, Arlo Parks,
OL,14,     GStereolab, The Smiths, Ibeyi and
OL,15,     Gmore.
OL,16,G1000FDeb Grant
OL,17,     GEmbrace the weekend with glorious
OL,18,     Gmusic, with Deb Grant. Covering
OL,19,     Gdub, funk, hip hop, soul, disco,
OL,20,     Grock and nu-wave vibes.
